{
  "$schema": "./schema.json",
  "day": 28,
  "level": 2,
  "title": { "en": "Colours", "es": "Los colores" },
  "objectives": [
    "Name the basic colours",
    "Put the adjective after the noun: un abrigo negro",
    "Make colours and sizes agree: una bufanda roja, unos guantes grises",
    "Ask ¿De qué color…?"
  ],
  "teach": [
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "md": "**Colours go after the noun**, and most agree like nationalities did on day 11:\n\n- **-o / -a**: *negro, negra* · *blanco, blanca* · *rojo, roja*: *un abrigo negro*, *una bufanda negra*\n- **one form for both**: *azul, verde, gris, marrón*: *un gorro azul*, *una chaqueta azul*\n\nPlurals add **-s** after a vowel and **-es** after a consonant: *negros*, *verdes*, *azules*, *grises*, *marrones* (the accent goes)."
    },
    { "kind": "phrase", "es": "un abrigo negro y una bufanda roja", "en": "a black coat and a red scarf" },
    { "kind": "phrase", "es": "¿De qué color es?", "en": "What colour is it?", "note": "Literally 'Of what colour is it?'. The answer: Es azul." },
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "md": "**Big and small**\n\n- **grande**: big (same for both genders): *un museo grande*, *una plaza grande*\n- **pequeño, pequeña**: small: *un bar pequeño*, *una tienda pequeña*\n\nFor clothes, *grande* and *pequeño* mean the size is wrong: *Es grande* = It's too big."
    },
    { "kind": "phrase", "es": "Es pequeña. ¿Tiene una talla grande?", "en": "It's small. Do you have a large size?", "note": "Pequeña, because la talla and la chaqueta are feminine." },
    { "kind": "phrase", "es": "un taxi blanco", "en": "a white taxi", "note": "Madrid taxis are white with a red stripe on the front doors. A green light on the roof means it's free." }
  ],
  "vocab": [
    { "id": "negro", "es": "negro, negra", "en": "black", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "ˈneɣɾo, ˈneɣɾa" },
    { "id": "blanco", "es": "blanco, blanca", "en": "white", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "ˈblaŋko, ˈblaŋka", "note": "Remember vino blanco." },
    { "id": "rojo", "es": "rojo, roja", "en": "red", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "ˈroxo, ˈroxa", "note": "Red wine is vino tinto, never vino rojo." },
    { "id": "azul", "es": "azul", "en": "blue", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "aˈθul", "note": "Same for m and f. Plural: azules." },
    { "id": "verde", "es": "verde", "en": "green", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "ˈbeɾðe" },
    { "id": "gris", "es": "gris", "en": "grey", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "ˈgɾis", "note": "Plural: grises." },
    { "id": "marron", "es": "marrón", "en": "brown", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "maˈron", "note": "Same for m and f. Plural: marrones." },
    { "id": "grande", "es": "grande", "en": "big, large", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "ˈgɾande" },
    { "id": "pequeno", "es": "pequeño, pequeña", "en": "small", "pos": "adj", "ipa": "peˈkeɲo, peˈkeɲa" },
    { "id": "de-que-color", "es": "¿De qué color…?", "en": "What colour…?", "pos": "phrase", "ipa": "de ˈke koˈloɾ", "tags": ["shopping"] }
  ],
  "exercises": [
